inal epithelial apoptosis and survival in a murine model of pneumonia-induced sepsis</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>2002</year><volume>287</volume><fpage>1716</fpage><lpage>1721</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11926897</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/jama.287.13.1716</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hassoun</surname><given-names>HT</given-names></name><name><surname>Kone</surname><given-names>BC</given-names></name><name><surname>Mercer</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name><name><surname>Moody</surname><given-names>FG</given-names></name><name><surname>Weisbrodt</surname><given-names>NW</given-names></name><name><surname>Moore</surname><given-names>FA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Post-injury multiple organ failure: the role of the gut</article-title><source>Shock</source><year>2001</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>10</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11198350</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00024382-200115010-00001</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hotchkiss</surname><given-names>RS</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmieg</surname><given-names>RE</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>Swanson</surname><given-names>PE</given-names></name><name><surname>Freeman</surname><given-names>BD</given-names></name><name><surname>Tinsley</surname><given-names>KW</given-names></name><name><surname>Cobb</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Karl</surname><given-names>IE</given-names></name><name><surname>Buchman</surname><given-names>TG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Rapid onset of intestinal epithelial and lymphocyte apoptotic cell death in patients with trauma and shock</article-title><source>Crit Care Med</source><year>2000</year><volume>28</volume><fpage>3